      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this CL, we have enabled the low-complexity decode mode for hdres by extending the following lc-dec speed features from shorts:\n\n- adaptive_luma_loop_filter_skip\n- gm_erroradv_tr_level\n- ref_frame_mvs_lvl\n- bias_warp_mode_rd_scale_pct\n- split_partition_penalty_level\n- bias_obmc_mode_rd_scale_pct\n\nThe visual quality tests showed no artifacts for both hdres and ugc-hdres contents.\n\nPerformance results of encoder and decoder for the streams generated with low complexity decode mode enabled.\n\n```\n                       Instruction Count    Decode Time\n                         Reduction(%)      Reduction(%)                    BD-Rate Loss(%)\ncpu   Resolution      Encoder    Decoder                  avg.psnr    ssim     vmaf   vmaf_neg  uvq_1p5 \n 1        HDRES2        3.477     22.716      19.057       1.3779    1.2776   1.3951   1.4730    1.6249 \n 1      UGCHDRES        1.597     24.258      19.130       0.7208    0.6534   0.7816   0.7914    0.4061 \n 1       Average        2.641     23.401      19.090       1.0859    1.0002   1.1225   1.1701    1.0832 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n 2        HDRES2        5.673     21.326      17.989       1.2968    1.1682   1.4135   1.4562    1.1208 \n 2      UGCHDRES        3.480     23.720      18.647       0.7288    0.6957   0.7181   0.7484    0.2880 \n 2       Average        4.699     22.390      18.282       1.0444    0.9582   1.1045   1.1416    0.7507 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n 3        HDRES2        5.417     20.802      16.925       1.2230    1.1199   1.3259   1.3151    1.7119 \n 3      UGCHDRES        4.040     24.418      18.428       0.9627    0.9011   1.0639   0.9165    0.5739 \n 3       Average        4.805     22.409      17.593       1.1073    1.0226   1.2095   1.1380    1.2061 \n```\n\nThe instruction count reduction specified has been measured using command:\n`$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./aomenc …`\n`$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./dav1d --cpumask avx2 …`\n\nThe decode time is measured using command\n`time taskset -c 0  ./dav1d  --cpumask avx2 …`",
